-### 3.4 Suki (ambient AI assistant + coding suggestions)
-
-- **What it is:** AI voice assistant for clinicians: ambient documentation, dictation, coding suggestions, patient summaries, and chart Q&A; also sells Suki Platform as an embedded AI engine (Zoom, MEDITECH, athenahealth partners). Works across Epic, MEDITECH, Oracle Health.
-- **Applied technology:** Ambient AI + hybrid dictation; EHR-agnostic integration strategy; utilization-based pricing models negotiated with clients (per-encounter with cap).
-- **Who uses it:** 350 health systems and clinics (Jan 2025); Rush University System for Health (enterprise-wide, 28→35 specialties, 243 active users), FMOL Health (132 users), McLeod Health (249 active users, 81% adoption, 150,000+ notes); first ambient integration into MEDITECH Expanse documentation APIs (July 2025, 20+ enterprise health systems, 100k+ encounters).
-- **Maturity:** $70M Series D (Oct 2024); Zoom Ventures investment announced Jan 30, 2025; $168M total raised; 4x growth in 2024.
