-### 3.7 Tortus (UK ambient voice, NHS-scale evaluation)
-
-- **What it is:** UK ambient voice technology (AVT) start-up; records and transcribes consultations, drafts structured notes/letters; UK GDPR compliant with no patient data retained for training; positioned for national NHS scale-up.
